            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Flow 3.11.2</h2><pre>Fix file-type sorting

“File type” now groups by the actual extension (APK, DMG, MKV, etc.), instead of broad categories that mixed APKs and DMGs together. Each extension group sorts naturally by the displayed filename. The direction arrow reverses the extension groups, keeping names alphabetical within each group.
</pre>]]></description>
