            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Flow 3.11.1</h2><pre>Clearer file icons

Compact, consistent file-type icons replace generic system document icons. Android packages have a green Android silhouette; videos, music, archives, images, PDFs, spreadsheets, installers and disk images have distinct symbols and restrained colors. Icons retain their small footprint and adapt to light/dark appearance.
</pre>]]></description>
